'''Meme''' is an admin-exclusive {{Mythical}} [[Blox Fruits|Blox Fruit]] that regular players cannot obtain unless it is given to them by an admin. Currently KittGaming is the only non-admin player to obtain this fruit.

There is no other way to obtain Meme besides being a developer or having an admin grant it to you. It has only one move, which can deal infinite damage to [[Allying|allies]], but does nothing to non-allied players. It is the epitome of a troll fruit, and only a select few group of people, such as administrators, have access to it.

Meme does not have a physical form or icon. This is because it is not obtainable in normal gameplay, making a physical form unnecessary. It is also different from other fruits in the sense that it only has one move, while even the most common and weak [[Blox Fruits]], such as [[Rocket]], have at least four moves. This is the second secret fruit added to the game, The first fruit being [[Rogue]].

