==Trivia==
* Meme was first revealed to the community in a video published by [https://www.youtube.com/c/Axiore Axiore]. You can see the video [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4nvYApKi6DA here].
* Meme is tradable and has infinite value, which was shown by [https://www.youtube.com/c/KittGaming KittGaming].
** To trade for Meme, the player will need a specific trade, as shown by [https://www.youtube.com/c/KittGaming KittGaming].
* Meme is typically impossible to obtain in gameplay, as it is not sold from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]] or the [[Blox Fruit Gacha]], cannot be found underneath [[trees]], and cannot be obtained from the [[Ship Raid]], the [[Pirate Raid]], or the [[Core]]. The only way to obtain it is to be an admin or to have it given to the player by an admin.
* [[Marines]] can attack each other or damage each other using Meme, including anyone in [[Safe Zone]]s.
* The previous owner of Meme was [https://twitter.com/_zioles Zioles], but soon [https://twitter.com/uzoth Uzoth] stole it from his "secret base" and gave it to [https://twitter.com/KittGamingYT KittGaming]. Right now, it is impossible to remove it from the player's [[inventory]], which is proven by [https://www.youtube.com/@KittGaming KittGaming].

